WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.253 --> 00:00:02.853
Your staff, your friends,

00:00:02.803 --> 00:00:06.510
or your regulars can all bring new customers to your salon.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:09.950
With Affiliate marketing, each person gets their own link.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:14.289
When a customer books through that link, VaraaAi credits the booking to them,

00:00:14.239 --> 00:00:15.230
with a commission.

00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:18.758
Tap Marketing, then Affiliate marketing at the top.

00:00:19.139 --> 00:00:20.357
Tap Add partner.

00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:24.997
Enter their name and email, and choose the commission, for example ten percent.

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:27.878
You can set your own link code, so it's easy to remember.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.317
Then tap Save.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:32.523
Your partner appears in the list, with their own link.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.003
Tap the copy button to send them the link.

00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:38.246
Or tap the QR code button to download their code,

00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:40.763
and print it on flyers or business cards.

00:00:41.105 --> 00:00:44.763
The partner shares the link, and customers tap it and book as usual.

00:00:45.401 --> 00:00:49.168
Each time a customer books through a link, VaraaAi records it for you:

00:00:49.278 --> 00:00:53.487
link clicks, bookings, the revenue they bring in, and the commission owed.

00:00:53.917 --> 00:00:55.968
VaraaAi only does the tracking:

00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:57.488
you pay your partners yourself.

00:00:57.684 --> 00:01:01.168
Once you've paid, record it, so your books always stay clear.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:02.608
Now take the quiz below.
